{\an8}SHIN DONGHYUN
KEJUARAAN O*E MUAY THAI FIGHTER

163
00:08:26.639 --> 00:08:29.809
Petarung yang menghadapi Shin Donghyun adalah...

164
00:08:33.947 --> 00:08:35.482
Kim Hyunjun.

165
00:08:36.082 --> 00:08:37.550
{\an8}Kim Hyunjun.

166
