- [tepuk tangan]
- [penonton bersorak]

712
00:36:40.131 --> 00:36:42.701
{\an8}Halo pemirsa.
Selamat datang di Perempatfinal <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

713
00:36:42.767 --> 00:36:45.837
{\an8}Saya penyiar olahraga Seong Seungheon,
